{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n80.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"146","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/146"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/146/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Halleluyah: Praise the Lord, O my soul, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/146/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"I shall praise the Lord in my life, I shall sing to the Lord as long as I exist. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/146/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Trust not in princes, in the son of man who has no power to help. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/146/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"When his spirit departs, he returns to his soil, on that day his thoughts perish. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/146/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Fortunate is he whose helper is the God of Jacob, whose hope is for the Lord, his God, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/146/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"who made heaven and earth, the sea and all that is in it, who keeps faith for ever. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/146/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He does justice for "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n82.jpg","n":"26"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"the oppressed and gives bread to the hungry, the Lord frees the fettered. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/146/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The Lord makes the blind see, the Lord straightens the bent, the Lord loves the righteous. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/146/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The Lord guards strangers, supports the orphan and the widow and the way of the wicked does He pervert. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/morning_psalm_146/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/146/10"}}
{"text":"The Lord will reign for ever, your God, O Zion, from generation to generation, Halleluyah."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
